 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Hey, {07 0b 00}do you know when \n{ff 00 00 06}Tom Nook{ff 00 00 00}'s birthday is?{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Kuule, {07 0b 00}kas sa tead, millal \non {ff 00 00 06}Tom Nooki{ff 00 00 00} sünnipäev?{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 0f 00}Ehhhh{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00} So hungry!\n{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 0f 00}Ehhh.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}{01 00 00 03 00} Nii näljane!\n{01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 04 00}{01 04 00}{01 00 00 05 00}{01 05 00}{07 04 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}no way!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}Hey, speaking of\n{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{09 08 00}{07 0d 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}, this is your\nchance to say something,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 01 00}{09 04 00}{01 04 00}{01 00 00 05 00}{01 05 00}{07 04 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}ei või olla!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 14 00}Kuule, temast rääkides,\n{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{09 08 00}{07 0d 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}, see on sinu\nvõimalus midagi öelda,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}It's on the 28th,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}See on 28. kuupäeval,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 04 00}Ohhh, {01 00 00 05 00}really? {01 00 00 05 00}This month?{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 14 00}Thanks, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 04 00}Ohhh, {01 00 00 05 00}tõesti? {01 00 00 05 00}Sel kuul?{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 14 00}Aitäh, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}That's the day my favorite\nmagazine gets delivered.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 13 00}{ff 00 00 02}Chillin' Magazine{ff 00 00 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nIt's a modern guide to the\nchillin' lifestyle,\n{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}Sel päeval tuuakse mu\nlemmikajakiri.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 13 00}{ff 00 00 02}Chillin' Magazine{ff 00 00 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nSee on moodne juhend\nlaisa elustiili kohta,\n{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Huh?! {07 15 00}{ff 00 00 02}Chillin' Magazine{ff 00 00 00}?!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 16 00}All I wanted to know was\n{ff 00 00 06}Tom Nook{ff 00 00 00}'s birthday!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{09 03 00}{09 01 00}Hey {04 1f 00}, \n{07 0b 00}do you know when it is?{09 09 00}{02 00 00 08 0a}\nOf course!\nNo clue...",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Ah?! {07 15 00}{ff 00 00 02}Chillin' Magazine{ff 00 00 00}?!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 16 00}Ma tahtsin ainult teada\n{ff 00 00 06}Tom Nooki{ff 00 00 00} sünnipäeva!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{09 03 00}{09 01 00}Kuule {04 1f 00}, \n{07 0b 00}kas sa tead, millal see on?{09 09 00}{02 00 00 08 0a}\nMuidugi!\nAimugi pole..."
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 09 00}{09 02 00}{09 04 00}{07 04 00}Wow, {04 1f 00}! Who knew\nyou cared so much?\n\n{07 16 00}I wish my brother was\nlike you, {04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 08 00}Sniff{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 09 00}{09 02 00}{09 04 00}{07 04 00}Vau, {04 1f 00}! Kes teadis,\net sa nii hoolid?\n\n{07 16 00}Soovin, et mu vend oleks\nsinu moodi, {04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 08 00}Nuuks{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 04 00}Hey, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 06 00}Don't cry, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{03 03 00 01}{09 02 00}{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 04 00}Kuule, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 06 00}Ära nuta, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{03 03 00 01}{09 02 00}{03 03 00 01}"
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}Whaaaat?!{01 00 00 0a 00} Shame on you,\n{04 1f 00}! That's totally\nweak, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}! {07 14 00}Boooooo!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}Miiidaaa?!{01 00 00 0a 00} Häbene,\n{04 1f 00}! See on täiesti\nnadi, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}! {07 14 00}Buuuuu!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Well, {01 00 00 05 00}{07 1b 00}it's not really my\nplace to say it{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Noh, {01 00 00 05 00}{07 1b 00}pole just minu\nasi seda öelda{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 06 00}Me too, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.\n\n\n{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}Hey! {07 0b 00}Do you think bananas\ncount as just a snack?\nOr is it a whole meal?{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 06 00}Mina ka, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.\n\n\n{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}Kuule! {07 0b 00}Kas sa arvad, et\nbanaan on lihtsalt suupiste?\nVõi on see terve söögikord?{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "en": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}You always ask the\nweirdest questions{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{09 04 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Hey {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, what do\nyou think, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}{02 00 00 0f 11}\nSnack!\nMeal!",
   "et": "{07 00 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Sa küsid alati kõige\nveidramaid küsimusi{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{09 04 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Kuule {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}, mida sina\narvad, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}{02 00 00 0f 11}\nSuupiste!\nSöögikord!"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{09 02 00}{07 16 00}Whaaaaaat?!{01 00 00 14 00} But {01 00 00 05 00}my dad\nlikes to eat a banana\nduring his meal!\nThink on that for a while.\nIt'll melt your brain!{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{09 02 00}{07 16 00}Miiidaaa?!{01 00 00 14 00} Aga {01 00 00 05 00}mu isa\nsööb banaani\nsöögikorra ajal!\nMõtle selle üle veidi.\nSee sulatab su aju!{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00},\nyour family seems really\nmessed up{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00},\nsinu pere tundub tõesti\nkummaline{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}."
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}I think they're a meal, too!{01 01 00}\n{07 13 00}Bananas remind me of my\nmom's home cooking{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}Ma arvan ka, et söögikord!{01 01 00}\n{07 13 00}Banaanid meenutavad mulle\nema kodutoitu{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 08 00}What?!{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 0b 00}What kind of stuff\ndoes she cook?!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 06 00}I'm so\ncurious, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 08 00}Mida?!{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 0b 00}Mis asju\nta teeb?!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 06 00}Ma olen nii\nuudishimulik, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "en": "{09 04 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}{09 04 00}Say something? {01 00 00 05 00}Err{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\nI didn't have anything to\ntell {04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 04 00}{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}{09 04 00}Midagi öelda? {01 00 00 05 00}Öö{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\nMul polnud midagi\ntalle, {04 1f 00}, öelda{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "en": "{07 16 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{07 15 00}Are you SURE you don't have\nanything to tell\n{04 1f 00}, {04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{07 16 00}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{07 15 00}Kas sa oled KINDEL, et sul\npole midagi öelda\ntalle, {04 1f 00}, {04 02 00}?{09 09 00}"
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}{09 06 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 09 00}I don't have anything\nto admit to{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.errr, I mean\nsay to {04 1f 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}{09 06 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00}{07 09 00}Mul pole midagi\nüles tunnistada{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.öö, ma\nmõtlen öelda talle, {04 1f 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{03 03 00 01}"
